2px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 5 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Gratuita:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Gratuita:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida BeActive Guimar\u00e3es 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento noturno realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada marcadas para as 21:00 junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Guimar\u00e3es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia da prova e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova cumpre a dist\u00e2ncia \u00fanica de 5 km em formato de corrida ou caminhada, sendo aberta a participantes de todas as idades e n\u00edveis de condi\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o tem algum custo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 totalmente gratuita at\u00e9 22 de Setembro em runporto.com, estando limitada a um contingente m\u00e1ximo de 2.500 vagas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os kits de participante s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Guimar\u00e3es (entrada A0) no dia 26 de Setembro das 10h00 \u00e0s 20h00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o da confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui dorsal de prova, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa BeActive (distribu\u00edda consoante o stock dispon\u00edvel) e abastecimento no final do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Beactive Guimar\u00e3es 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Guimar\u00e3es (Alameda do Multiusos)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guimar\u00e3es\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"IPDJ, Porto Antistress Clube (Runporto) e Munic\u00edpio de Guimar\u00e3es\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida BeActive Guimar\u00e3es 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento noturno realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada marcadas para as 21:00 junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Guimar\u00e3es.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia da prova e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova cumpre a dist\u00e2ncia \u00fanica de 5 km em formato de corrida ou caminhada, sendo aberta a participantes de todas as idades e n\u00edveis de condi\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A participa\u00e7\u00e3o tem algum custo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 totalmente gratuita at\u00e9 22 de Setembro em runporto.com, estando limitada a um contingente m\u00e1ximo de 2.500 vagas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os kits de participante s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Guimar\u00e3es (entrada A0) no dia 26 de Setembro das 10h00 \u00e0s 20h00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o da confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui dorsal de prova, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa BeActive (distribu\u00edda consoante o stock dispon\u00edvel) e abastecimento no final do evento.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66189,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,478],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47640","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-guimaraes-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_3-gratuita-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/corrida-beactive-guimaraes-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47640","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/a